  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="2.6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IVAtr">IV Atr</ref> 2.6</head>
        <ab type="liebermannText" xml:lang="la" source="#liebermann" n="2.6" corresp="#wit-q">Flandrenses et Ponteienses et Normannia et Francia monstrabant res suas et extolneabant.</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="2.6" corresp="#wit-q">Flandrenses et Ponteienses et Normannia et Francia monstrabant res suas et extolneabant.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-q">Men of Flanders and Ponthieu and Normandy and the Isle of France exhibited their goods and paid toll.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Die Flandrer und die von Ponthieu und Normandie und Francien legten ihre Waaren [gleich in London] zur Schau und zahlten Zoll.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">The Flemings and those from Ponthieu and Normandy and the Île-de-France displayed their goods [at once in London] and paid toll.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
